@context: Every kind of form control — text, typing, dropdown, radio, checkbox — and checking their state.
@title: forms

@var: {site} = http://localhost:8000

STEP 1: Text fields
    NAVIGATE to {site}/form.html
    FILL 'Full name' field with 'Ada Lovelace'
    FILL 'Email' field with 'ada@example.com'
    # TYPE presses keys one by one, for fields that react to typing.
    TYPE '+380 44 000 0000' into the 'Phone' field
    VERIFY 'Full name' field has value 'Ada Lovelace'
    VERIFY 'Email' field has placeholder 'name@example.com'

STEP 2: Dropdowns, radios and checkboxes
    SELECT 'Japan' from the 'Country' dropdown
    VERIFY that 'Free' is checked
    CLICK the radio button for 'Pro'
    VERIFY that 'Pro' is checked
    UNCHECK the checkbox for 'Newsletter'
    VERIFY that 'Newsletter' is NOT checked

STEP 3: A button that unlocks
    VERIFY that 'Create account' is disabled
    CHECK the checkbox for 'I accept the Terms'
    VERIFY that 'Create account' is enabled
    CLICK the 'Create account' button
    VERIFY that 'Thanks, Ada Lovelace! Plan: pro, country: Japan, newsletter: no' is present

DONE.
